(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > requires ld64.lld and llvm-strip from the toolchain [30.08ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > rust-only mode skips SDK resolution (no Mach-O tools needed) [127.54ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > deployment target is overridable [16.47ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > compile and link flags target the SDK through ld64.lld [73.15ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > arm64 cross links reserve an ad-hoc code signature; x64 ships unsigned [35.52ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > cross release links get safe ICF backed by the address-significance table [25.58ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > link and strip commands run macho-postlink with the stack size and entitlements [42.28ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > native links don't get a postlink command [15.84ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > the __BUN sectalign workaround applies to x64 only [31.80ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > rust side cross-compiles to apple-darwin triples from linux [29.05ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > WebKit prebuilt resolves to the macOS tarball with a macos-keyed cache dir [33.78ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > rust-lld links compress ELF debug sections post-link, not at link time [37.16ms]
(pass) macOS cross-compile config (non-darwin host) > linux configs don't pick up darwin cross machinery [18.87ms]
(pass) host-side features.json for cross-compiled binaries > parsed feature list matches crash_handler.getFeatureData() exactly [543.11ms]
(pass) macOS SDK resolution > an explicit path must point at an SDK [9.51ms]
(pass) macOS SDK resolution > MACOS_SDK_PATH is honored [3.58ms]
(pass) macOS SDK resolution > falls back to an installed SDK or the pinned cache-dir download path [3.41ms]
(pass) macOS SDK resolution > a stale cached SDK does not shadow the pinned version [4.12ms]

